eft;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=8;spacing=0;fontColor=#c00000;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1308.0" y="1570.5" width="180.0" height="15.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c324" value="&lt;b&gt;Quote in mm&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;dal bordo alto piastra" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=7;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1290.0" y="237.0" width="192.0" height="42.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c325" value="canaline 25 mm&lt;br&gt;guide: centrare sull'asse rosso&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;In larghezza&lt;/b&gt; (dal bordo sinistro):&lt;br&gt;canalina sx 0–25&lt;br&gt;canalina dx 275–300&lt;br&gt;orizzontali lunghe 250&lt;br&gt;guide da 27 a 273 (246)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=7;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1290.0" y="1824.0" width="192.0" height="180.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c326" value="&lt;b&gt;Legenda&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='background:#f8cecc'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; 230 V · &lt;span style='background:#dae8fc'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; bassa tensione 12 V · &lt;span style='background:#fff2cc'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; contattori&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='background:#97d077'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; morsetti di terra (si serrano sulla guida) · &lt;span style='background:#7ea6e0'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; neutro&lt;br&gt;X3: &lt;span style='background:#c3a6e8'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; RS485 B · &lt;span style='background:#ffc98a'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; RS485 A · &lt;span style='background:#4d4d4d'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; 0 V · &lt;span style='background:#ea6b66'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; +12 V (colori indicativi: i morsetti del kit sono grigi, usa i marcafili)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Note&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Scala: 1 mm = 3 px. Misure in mm.&lt;br&gt;• Vano interno 341×548×189 (dato venditore). &lt;b&gt;Piastra 300×510 stimata&lt;/b&gt;: misurala all'arrivo, poi si spostano i blocchi.&lt;br&gt;• 4 guide DIN da ~246 mm, 240 utili tra le canaline laterali.&lt;br&gt;• G1: T1 + Waveshare ≈ 206 mm · G2: display + X3 ≈ 216 mm · G3: 6 contattori ≈ 108 mm + X5 con F1, F2 ≈ 67 mm · G4: Q1, X0, contatore, X2 ≈ 181 mm.&lt;br&gt;• Display D1 in alto: si legge attraverso lo sportello trasparente e si tocca aprendolo.&lt;br&gt;• Profondità interna 189 mm: verificare che display su clip e Waveshare con RTC non tocchino lo sportello.&lt;br&gt;• Fase ai contattori in catena sul morsetto 1 con puntalini doppi.&lt;br&gt;• Morsetti UK2.5B larghi 5,2 mm; 1 modulo = 17,5 mm.&lt;br&gt;• Ponticelli: X0 1-2, 3-4 · X2 7-10 · X3 1-3, 4-6, 7-9, 10-12 · X5 2-3, 4-6 (X5 1 da solo).&lt;br&gt;• Fusibili 5×20 su portafusibili UK5-HESI: F1 → W3 camera (X5 2-3), F2 → W6 cantina (X5 1). F1 1 A T, F2 0,25 A T (ritardati)." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1470.0" y="150.0" width="720.0" height="990.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c327" value="&lt;b&gt;Fili&lt;/b&gt; (livelli «Fili 230 V» e «Fili bassa tensione»)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#8B4513'&gt;━━&lt;/span&gt; fase L · &lt;span style='color:#1E56C8'&gt;━━&lt;/span&gt; neutro N · &lt;span style='color:#2E9B2E'&gt;╍╍&lt;/span&gt; terra&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#E00000'&gt;━━&lt;/span&gt; +12 V · &lt;span style='color:#000000'&gt;━━&lt;/span&gt; 0 V · &lt;span style='color:#E0399A'&gt;━━&lt;/span&gt; relè → + bobina contattore&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#FF8C00'&gt;━━&lt;/span&gt; RS485 A · &lt;span style='color:#8A2BE2'&gt;━━&lt;/span&gt; RS485 B&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#FF6A00'&gt;━●━●&lt;/span&gt; ponticello tra morsetti · &lt;span style='color:#999999'&gt;███&lt;/span&gt; cavi con guaina&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• X3 sopra: Waveshare, alimentatore, COM relè, contatore, ritorno bobine. X3 sotto: A e B dei Cat5e, display, ingressi di F1 e F2, 0 V verso X5.&lt;br&gt;• X5 sopra: alimentazione dei Cat5e. X5 sotto: uscite di F1 e F2, 0 V da X3.&lt;br&gt;• Un solo filo per foro su X3. Puntalini doppi solo sui COM dei relè e sui contattori (catene).&lt;br&gt;• I fili relè → bobine (12 V, H05V-K) scendono nella canalina sinistra insieme ai 230 V: isolamento 300/500 V.&lt;br&gt;• Posizione dei morsetti su alimentatore, Waveshare, display e contatore indicativa." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1470.0" y="1170.0" width="720.0" height="600.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c201" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;rounded=0;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=6;strokeColor=#777777;strokeWidth=10;opacity=55;" edge="1" parent="L230"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="240.0" y="1950.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="240.0" y="1809.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c202" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;rounded=0;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=6;strokeColor=#8B4513;strokeWidth=2.4;" edge="1" parent="L230"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="240.0" y="1809.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="312.0" y="1450.5" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="231.0" y="1800.0"/><mxPoint x="231.0" y="1416.0"/><mxPoint x="312.0" y="1416.0"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c203" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;rounded=0;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=6;strokeColor=#1E56C8;strokeWidth=2.4;" edge="1" parent="L230"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="240.0" y="1809.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="339.0" y="1450.5" as="targetPoint"/><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="222.0" y="1800.0"/><mxPoint x="222.0" y="1411.5"/><mxPoint x="339.0" y="1411.5"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c204" value="" style="end